### Read the detail (configure baseUrl and accessToken in the HTTP client environment)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/planning/tarieven/12/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update using the ETag returned by GET (configure currentEtag including its quotes)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/planning/tarieven/12/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
If-Match: {{currentEtag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "functie": "Machinist",
  "actief": true,
  "prijs": 55.25,
  "eenheid": "uur",
  "geldigVanaf": "2026-01-01"
}

### Missing precondition returns 428
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/planning/tarieven/12/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "functie": "Machinist",
  "actief": true,
  "prijs": 55.25,
  "eenheid": "uur",
  "geldigVanaf": "2026-01-01"
}
